Actually, I suggested (as quoted above) that small sites not even run 
it.  I do not run arbitron yet; I only have about 25 people reading 
Usenet on a regular basis.  When I have more than 100 users reading, 
that should remove any "process of elimination" worries; at that point, 
I'll start running arbitron.

