that means anything) agreed that the legal doctrine of "limited public
forums" had a high potential applicability to Usenet.

Under that doctrine, the administrators of the forum have the authority
to both determine and enforce the topicality of each forum.  It would
seem that most of us view each Usenet newsgroup as a separate limited
public forum.  It would seem, then, that each local administration can,
indeed, institute and enforce the restrictions to which you refer with
