Actually, I have been the victim of precisely these arguments in rec.pets.cats
and misc.writing.  Each time, some people yelled "charter violation".  In the
case of rec.pets.cats, one of our system administrators concurred.  His
decision was quickly overruled.



> >The solution is to improve the way that E-mail is processed on the network. 
> 
